"Stage_Sheol_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/71/Stage_Sheol_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073042\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cathedral\" title=\"Cathedral\"><img alt=\"Stage Cathedral icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Cathedral icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Cathedral_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e3/Stage_Cathedral_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072841\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Room\" title=\"Dark Room\"><img alt=\"Stage Dark Room icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dark Room icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/60/Stage_Dark_Room_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072941\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_(Floor)\" title=\"Chest\"><img alt=\"Chest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Chest icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Chest_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/25/Stage_Chest_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825114034\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawl_Space\" title=\"Crawl Space\"><img alt=\"Crawl Space Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Crawl Space Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Crawl_Space_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/74/Crawl_Space_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824165118\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n <p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"disambig-notice\">This article is about the enemy.&#32;For the item, see <a href=\"/wiki/Lil_Haunt\" title=\"Lil Haunt\">Lil Haunt</a>.&#32;For the boss, see <a href=\"/wiki/The_Haunt\" title=\"The Haunt\">The Haunt</a>.</div>\n<p><b>Lil' Haunts</b> are ghost enemies that slightly mimic the movements of Isaac, which allows them to \"chase\" him if Isaac constantly tries running away from them. Occasionally, they stop to spew blood shots towards the location Isaac will be in if he doesn't stop moving; this did not have an animation up till <a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Repentance\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Repentance\">Repentance</a>, making it difficult to telegraph. \n</p><p>Three Lil' Haunts circle <a href=\"/wiki/The_Haunt\" title=\"The Haunt\">The Haunt</a> in its first phase. The first one charges at Isaac, and after the first is killed, the second and third charge at Isaac. <a href=\"/wiki/The_Haunt#Champion_Versions\" title=\"The Haunt\">The Black Champion Haunt</a> will be circled by two Lil' Haunts, and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Haunt#Champion_Versions\" title=\"The Haunt\">The Pink Champion Haunt</a> will only be circled by one.\n</p>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/binding